</li>
<li data-start=3D"629" data-end=3D"648">
<p data-start=3D"631" data-end=3D"648">The backend URL</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"649" data-end=3D"671">
<p data-start=3D"651" data-end=3D"671">The file structure</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"672" data-end=3D"690">
<p data-start=3D"674" data-end=3D"690">The .env setup</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"692" data-end=3D"754">Therefore, the questions were <stron=
