></h1>
<p data-start=3D"811" data-end=3D"876"><strong data-start=3D"811" data-end=
=3D"876">Because you asked for Option B: a clean rebuild from scratch.</str=
ong></p>
<p data-start=3D"878" data-end=3D"994">To rebuild the project <em data-star=
t=3D"901" data-end=3D"912">from zero</em> (fresh, stable, modern), I cannot=
 assume previous values unless you confirm them.</p>
<p data-start=3D"996" data-end=3D"1105">When rebuilding a backend from scra=
tch, there are <strong data-start=3D"1046" data-end=3D"1067">2 critical val=
ues</strong> that change how the system must work:</p>
