<h3 data-start=3D"535" data-end=3D"554">What this does:</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"555" data-end=3D"732">
<li data-start=3D"555" data-end=3D"614">
<p data-start=3D"557" data-end=3D"614"><code data-start=3D"557" data-end=3D=
"576">maxWidth: "120px"</code> =E2=86=92 stops it from stretching sideways<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"615" data-end=3D"659">
<p data-start=3D"617" data-end=3D"659"><code data-start=3D"617" data-end=3D=
"639">whiteSpace: "normal"</code> =E2=86=92 allows wrapping</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"660" data-end=3D"732">
<p data-start=3D"662" data-end=3D"732"><code data-start=3D"662" data-end=3D=
"686">wordWrap: "break-word"</code> =E2=86=92 wraps long words instead of p=
ushing table</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"734" data-end=3D"813">You can adjust the width to 100px / =
150px depending on how much space you want.</p>
