<hr data-start=3D"1246" data-end=3D"1249">
<h1 data-start=3D"1251" data-end=3D"1283">=E2=AD=90 Why tableLayout: fixed =
works</h1>
<h3 data-start=3D"1285" data-end=3D"1300">Without it:</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1301" data-end=3D"1384">Table looks at all content =E2=86=
=92 picks the largest width =E2=86=92 forces entire row to expand.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"1386" data-end=3D"1398">With it:</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1399" data-end=3D"1469">Table respects the width you assig=
n =E2=86=92 wraps text =E2=86=92 layout stays clean.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1471" data-end=3D"1474">
<h1 data-start=3D"1476" data-end=3D"1518">=F0=9F=A7=AA What to expect after=
