<p data-start=3D"1521" data-end=3D"1574">=E2=80=9COther Requirement=E2=80=
=9D column will <strong data-start=3D"1553" data-end=3D"1572">shrink to 150=
px</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1575" data-end=3D"1621">
<p data-start=3D"1577" data-end=3D"1621">Long text will <strong data-start=
=3D"1592" data-end=3D"1605">wrap down</strong>, not sideways</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1622" data-end=3D"1674">
<p data-start=3D"1624" data-end=3D"1674">Table will no longer stretch beyon=
d screen width</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1675" data-end=3D"1712">
<p data-start=3D"1677" data-end=3D"1712">Columns will be evenly controlled<=
/p>
</li>
</ul>
