<li data-start=3D"1191" data-end=3D"1249">
<p data-start=3D"1193" data-end=3D"1249"><code data-start=3D"1193" data-end=
=3D"1209">width: "120px"</code> suggests the desired width (not forced)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1250" data-end=3D"1321">
<p data-start=3D"1252" data-end=3D"1321"><code data-start=3D"1252" data-end=
=3D"1274">whiteSpace: "normal"</code> makes text wrap instead of staying on=
 one line</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1322" data-end=3D"1399">
<p data-start=3D"1324" data-end=3D"1399"><code data-start=3D"1324" data-end=
=3D"1349">wordBreak: "break-word"</code> prevents long words from pushing t=
he column wider</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1401" data-end=3D"1461">This combination <strong data-star=
t=3D"1418" data-end=3D"1460">does NOT disturb the rest of the table</strong=
>.</p>
