<p data-start=3D"0" data-end=3D"43">Understood =E2=80=94 <strong data-start=
=3D"13" data-end=3D"42">two new problems appeared</strong>:</p>
<h1 data-start=3D"45" data-end=3D"86">=E2=9D=97 PROBLEM 1 =E2=80=94 Booking=
 Form is missing</h1>
<h1 data-start=3D"87" data-end=3D"143">=E2=9D=97 PROBLEM 2 =E2=80=94 Notify=
 Client button still not working</h1>
<p data-start=3D"145" data-end=3D"193">Both issues are symptoms of <strong =
data-start=3D"173" data-end=3D"192">a backend crash</strong>.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"195" data-end=3D"241">When the backend (Node.js) fails to=
 start:</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"242" data-end=3D"528">
<li data-start=3D"242" data-end=3D"347">
<p data-start=3D"244" data-end=3D"347">The Booking Form (client form) <stro=
ng data-start=3D"275" data-end=3D"295">cannot load data</strong>, so the pa=
ge may appear blank or partially missing.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"348" data-end=3D"451">
<p data-start=3D"350" data-end=3D"451">The Notify button fails because the =
backend is <strong data-start=3D"397" data-end=3D"412">not running</strong>=
, causing <code data-start=3D"422" data-end=3D"439">Failed to fetch</code> =
or <strong data-start=3D"443" data-end=3D"450">404</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"452" data-end=3D"528">
<p data-start=3D"454" data-end=3D"528">Frontend pages randomly disappear be=
cause React cannot fetch backend data.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"530" data-end=3D"610">This is VERY common right after addi=
ng a large route (like the Notify route) if:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"612" data-end=3D"807">
<li data-start=3D"612" data-end=3D"636">
<p data-start=3D"614" data-end=3D"636">A bracket is missing</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"637" data-end=3D"668">
<p data-start=3D"639" data-end=3D"668">A require/import is missing</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"669" data-end=3D"715">
<p data-start=3D"671" data-end=3D"715">Nodemailer function <code data-start=
=3D"691" data-end=3D"702">sendEmail</code> is missing</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"716" data-end=3D"748">
<p data-start=3D"718" data-end=3D"748">BookingModel is not imported</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"749" data-end=3D"807">
<p data-start=3D"751" data-end=3D"807">The route was pasted inside another =
route accidentally</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"809" data-end=3D"812">
<h1 data-start=3D"814" data-end=3D"867">=E2=9C=85 STEP 1 =E2=80=94 I need t=
o see your <strong data-start=3D"846" data-end=3D"865">backend console</str=
ong></h1>
<p data-start=3D"868" data-end=3D"924">Please go to the terminal where your=
 backend is running.</p>
<p data-start=3D"926" data-end=3D"962">You should see <strong data-start=3D=
"941" data-end=3D"961">an error message</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"964" data-end=3D"982">It will look like:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"984" data-end=3D"1172">
<li data-start=3D"984" data-end=3D"1028">
<p data-start=3D"986" data-end=3D"1028"><code data-start=3D"986" data-end=
=3D"1028">ReferenceError: sendEmail is not defined</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1029" data-end=3D"1066">
<p data-start=3D"1031" data-end=3D"1066"><code data-start=3D"1031" data-end=
=3D"1066">SyntaxError: Unexpected token '}'</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1067" data-end=3D"1103">
<p data-start=3D"1069" data-end=3D"1103"><code data-start=3D"1069" data-end=
=3D"1103">Cannot find module './sendEmail'</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1104" data-end=3D"1158">
<p data-start=3D"1106" data-end=3D"1158"><code data-start=3D"1106" data-end=
=3D"1158">TypeError: BookingModel.findById is not a function</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1159" data-end=3D"1172">
<p data-start=3D"1161" data-end=3D"1172">or similar.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1174" data-end=3D"1244">=F0=9F=91=89 <strong data-start=3D=
"1177" data-end=3D"1244">Please copy and paste the EXACT backend terminal e=
rror message.</strong></p>
