          &lt;div style=3D"padding:20px 25px;"&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;Dear &lt;strong&gt;${updatedBooking.name}&lt;/strong&g=
t;,&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;We are pleased to confirm your booking. Below is a sum=
mary of your service request:&lt;/p&gt;

            &lt;table style=3D"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-s=
ize:15px;"&gt;
