<h1 data-start=3D"947" data-end=3D"974">=E2=9C=85 STEP 4 =E2=80=94 Test on =
iPhone</h1>
<p data-start=3D"976" data-end=3D"1001">Open the email on iPhone.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1003" data-end=3D"1029">Tap <strong data-start=3D"1007" da=
ta-end=3D"1028">Cancel My Booking</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1031" data-end=3D"1196">=F0=9F=9F=A2 <strong data-start=3D=
"1034" data-end=3D"1095">Safari should now load the cancellation page succe=
ssfully</strong><br data-start=3D"1095" data-end=3D"1098">
=F0=9F=9F=A2 Status in Booking Summary should update to <strong data-start=
=3D"1144" data-end=3D"1157">Cancelled</strong><br data-start=3D"1157" data-=
end=3D"1160">
=F0=9F=9F=A2 No error =E2=80=9CWeb page not available=E2=80=9D</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1198" data-end=3D"1201">
<h1 data-start=3D"1203" data-end=3D"1222">=E2=AD=90 IMPORTANT NOTES</h1>
<h3 data-start=3D"1224" data-end=3D"1289">=F0=9F=94=B5 Your iPhone and Mac =
<strong data-start=3D"1251" data-end=3D"1287">must be on the same WiFi netw=
ork</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"1290" data-end=3D"1339">Otherwise the iPhone cannot reach =
the Mac server.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"1341" data-end=3D"1394">=F0=9F=94=B5 If your WiFi changes=
, your Mac IP may change</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1395" data-end=3D"1445">Then you must update <code data-st=
art=3D"1416" data-end=3D"1422">.env</code> again with the new IP.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1447" data-end=3D"1450">
<h1 data-start=3D"1452" data-end=3D"1470">=F0=9F=9A=80 READY TO TEST</h1>
