<ul data-start=3D"484" data-end=3D"574">
<li data-start=3D"484" data-end=3D"509">
<p data-start=3D"486" data-end=3D"509">Date-wise full report</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"513" data-end=3D"538">
<p data-start=3D"515" data-end=3D"538">Client-wise breakdown</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"542" data-end=3D"574">
<p data-start=3D"544" data-end=3D"574">Monthly summary auto-generated</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"576" data-end=3D"711">
<p data-start=3D"579" data-end=3D"631"><strong data-start=3D"579" data-end=
=3D"629">Add authentication (Admin login + Staff login)</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"635" data-end=3D"711">
<li data-start=3D"635" data-end=3D"666">
<p data-start=3D"637" data-end=3D"666">Prevent unauthorized access</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"670" data-end=3D"711">
<p data-start=3D"672" data-end=3D"711">Track which staff performed the upda=
tes</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"713" data-end=3D"823">
<p data-start=3D"716" data-end=3D"760"><strong data-start=3D"716" data-end=
=3D"734">Add PDF export</strong> (instead of just Excel)</p>
<ul data-start=3D"764" data-end=3D"823">
<li data-start=3D"764" data-end=3D"823">
<p data-start=3D"766" data-end=3D"823">Useful for invoices, reports, or sha=
ring with management.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"825" data-end=3D"978">
<p data-start=3D"828" data-end=3D"858"><strong data-start=3D"828" data-end=
=3D"856">Deploy the system online</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"862" data-end=3D"978">
<li data-start=3D"862" data-end=3D"902">
<p data-start=3D"864" data-end=3D"902">So cancellation links work on iPhone=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"906" data-end=3D"945">
<p data-start=3D"908" data-end=3D"945">Your staff can access from anywhere<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"949" data-end=3D"978">
<p data-start=3D"951" data-end=3D"978">No need to run local server</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"980" data-end=3D"1100">
<p data-start=3D"983" data-end=3D"1022"><strong data-start=3D"983" data-end=
=3D"1020">Start building mobile app version</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"1026" data-end=3D"1100">
<li data-start=3D"1026" data-end=3D"1062">
<p data-start=3D"1028" data-end=3D"1062">React Native app for MGA Connect</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1066" data-end=3D"1100">
<p data-start=3D"1068" data-end=3D"1100">Client booking + Staff dashboard</=
p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
