<hr data-start=3D"922" data-end=3D"925">
<h1 data-start=3D"927" data-end=3D"946">=E2=9C=94 What this does:</h1>
<h3 data-start=3D"948" data-end=3D"968">=F0=9F=93=8C While typing:</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"969" data-end=3D"1098">
<li data-start=3D"969" data-end=3D"1009">
<p data-start=3D"971" data-end=3D"1009">Allows digits and 1 decimal point o=
nly</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1010" data-end=3D"1034">
<p data-start=3D"1012" data-end=3D"1034">No letters, no symbols</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1035" data-end=3D"1098">
<p data-start=3D"1037" data-end=3D"1098">Does NOT auto-format while typing =
(more comfortable for user)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"1100" data-end=3D"1139">=F0=9F=93=8C When leaving the fie=
ld (onBlur):</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1140" data-end=3D"1326">
<li data-start=3D"1140" data-end=3D"1189">
<p data-start=3D"1142" data-end=3D"1189">Converts the number into <strong d=
ata-start=3D"1167" data-end=3D"1189">two-decimal format</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1190" data-end=3D"1326">
<p data-start=3D"1192" data-end=3D"1200">Example:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1203" data-end=3D"1326">
<li data-start=3D"1203" data-end=3D"1236">
<p data-start=3D"1205" data-end=3D"1236">typing <code data-start=3D"1212" d=
ata-end=3D"1217">500</code> =E2=86=92 becomes <code data-start=3D"1228" dat=
a-end=3D"1236">500.00</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1239" data-end=3D"1276">
<p data-start=3D"1241" data-end=3D"1276">typing <code data-start=3D"1248" d=
ata-end=3D"1256">1250.5</code> =E2=86=92 becomes <code data-start=3D"1267" =
data-end=3D"1276">1250.50</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1279" data-end=3D"1326">
<p data-start=3D"1281" data-end=3D"1326">typing <code data-start=3D"1288" d=
ata-end=3D"1297">900.456</code> =E2=86=92 becomes <code data-start=3D"1308"=
 data-end=3D"1316">900.46</code> (rounded)</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"1328" data-end=3D"1378">=F0=9F=93=8C Saved into MongoDB w=
ith correct formatting.</h3>
<hr data-start=3D"1380" data-end=3D"1383">
<h1 data-start=3D"1385" data-end=3D"1451">=E2=AD=90 Want it to auto-format =
<strong data-start=3D"1412" data-end=3D"1430">as staff types</strong>, inst=
ead of on blur?</h1>
<p data-start=3D"1452" data-end=3D"1502">Example: typing <code data-start=
=3D"1468" data-end=3D"1474">1000</code> immediately shows <code data-start=
=3D"1493" data-end=3D"1502">1000.00</code></p>
<p data-start=3D"1504" data-end=3D"1560">I can provide that too =E2=80=94 t=
ell me which style you prefer:</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"1562" data-end=3D"1626">Option A =E2=80=94 Format <strong=
 data-start=3D"1584" data-end=3D"1616">after staff leaves the field</strong=
> (current)</h3>
<h3 data-start=3D"1627" data-end=3D"1675">Option B =E2=80=94 Format <strong=
 data-start=3D"1649" data-end=3D"1675">live while staff types</strong></h3>
