<ul data-start=3D"1677" data-end=3D"2015">
<li data-start=3D"1677" data-end=3D"1722">
<p data-start=3D"1679" data-end=3D"1722">=E2=9C=94 Invoice Summary excludes=
 cancelled rows</p>
