<li data-start=3D"1723" data-end=3D"1792">
<p data-start=3D"1725" data-end=3D"1792">=E2=9C=94 Invoice Details will now=
 show <strong data-start=3D"1757" data-end=3D"1790">only active/notified bo=
okings</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1793" data-end=3D"1863">
<p data-start=3D"1795" data-end=3D"1863">=E2=9C=94 Cancelled entries will <=
strong data-start=3D"1820" data-end=3D"1861">never appear in downloadable i=
nvoices</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1864" data-end=3D"1936">
<p data-start=3D"1866" data-end=3D"1936">=E2=9C=94 Clients who only have ca=
ncelled bookings will disappear completely</p>
