em data-start=3D"538" data-end=3D"555">existing fields</em> that are not eq=
ual.</p>
<p data-start=3D"577" data-end=3D"612">So MongoDB interprets it like this:<=
/p>
<ul data-start=3D"614" data-end=3D"783">
<li data-start=3D"614" data-end=3D"667">
<p data-start=3D"616" data-end=3D"667">Cancelled entries =E2=86=92 have <co=
