<li data-start=3D"668" data-end=3D"727">
<p data-start=3D"670" data-end=3D"727">Valid entries =E2=86=92 have NO <cod=
e data-start=3D"694" data-end=3D"702">status</code> field =E2=86=92 FILTERE=
D OUT =E2=9D=8C</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"728" data-end=3D"783">
<p data-start=3D"730" data-end=3D"783">Cancelled entries remain because the=
ir status exists!</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"785" data-end=3D"822">This is why your result got inverted=
.</p>
