<p data-start=3D"1157" data-end=3D"1207">If <strong data-start=3D"1160" dat=
a-end=3D"1171">1 match</strong> =E2=86=92 then problem is inside the block.=
</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1209" data-end=3D"1239">Tell me the number of matches.</p>
