<ul data-start=3D"1313" data-end=3D"1601">
<li data-start=3D"1313" data-end=3D"1378">
<p data-start=3D"1315" data-end=3D"1378">There is a second <code data-start=
=3D"1333" data-end=3D"1352">/invoices/summary</code> route lower in the fil=
e</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1379" data-end=3D"1426">
<p data-start=3D"1381" data-end=3D"1426">A rogue extra <code data-start=3D"=
1395" data-end=3D"1398">}</code> closed the function early</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1427" data-end=3D"1475">
<p data-start=3D"1429" data-end=3D"1475">The <code data-start=3D"1433" data=
-end=3D"1441">$match</code> block is inside the wrong stage</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1476" data-end=3D"1538">
<p data-start=3D"1478" data-end=3D"1538">A syntax error prevents the server=
 from reloading properly</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1539" data-end=3D"1601">
<p data-start=3D"1541" data-end=3D"1601">Or the database contains <code dat=
a-start=3D"1566" data-end=3D"1588">status: " Cancelled"</code> (with space)=
</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1603" data-end=3D"1637">Then the match rule does not fire.=
</p>
