<h1 data-start=3D"743" data-end=3D"767">=E2=9D=97 Why This Is Critical</h1>
<p data-start=3D"768" data-end=3D"795">Your invoice problem means:</p>
<p data-start=3D"797" data-end=3D"919"><strong data-start=3D"797" data-end=
=3D"874">The cancelled records inside MongoDB do NOT contain exactly <code =
data-start=3D"859" data-end=3D"872">"Cancelled"</code></strong><br data-sta=
rt=3D"874" data-end=3D"877">
That's why all our filters have no effect.</p>
<p data-start=3D"921" data-end=3D"997">Until we see the <strong data-start=
=3D"938" data-end=3D"960">real stored values</strong>, we cannot build the =
correct filter.</p>
